1
00:00:00,418 --> 00:00:01,658
(Sheldon:)Oh...

2
00:00:06,558 --> 00:00:08,898
(Sheldon:)-Embarrassed you?
-You know what?

3
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:11,300
(Amy:)I don't have time for this.
Find another way home.

4
00:00:11,429 --> 00:00:14,309
(Sheldon:)I'm starting to get the sense
that you're angry with me.

5
00:00:14,399 --> 00:00:16,739
(Amy:)-Really? What tipped you off?
-Couple things, actually.

6
00:00:16,768 --> 00:00:18,108
(Sheldon:)Your tone of voice,
your body language--

7
00:00:18,169 --> 00:00:19,579
(Amy:)-Get out.
-Well, now, that.

8
00:00:22,007 --> 00:00:24,287
Image number six: woman giving birth.

9
00:00:24,442 --> 00:00:25,822
Oh!

10
00:00:33,485 --> 00:00:35,695
It's 9:00. Where you been?

11
00:00:35,787 --> 00:00:38,497
(Sheldon:)I had to take the bus home.

12
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:41,830
(Sheldon:)Fell asleep and missed my stop.

13
00:00:41,927 --> 00:00:43,597
(Sheldon:)Oh, no.

14
00:00:43,628 --> 00:00:47,508
(Sheldon:)Did you know that Los Angeles has
a Little Sri Lanka?

15
00:00:47,532 --> 00:00:51,772
(Leonard:)-I did not.
-Well, I do... now.

16
00:00:51,836 --> 00:00:55,046
(Sheldon:)They're a lovely people.

17
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:58,120
(Sheldon:)Although terrifying when you wake up
face-to-face with them.

18
00:00:58,209 --> 00:01:02,519
(Sheldon:)If you're hungry, I brought home
some mutton in coconut milk.

